  "title": "Banff Centre - Request for Proposal - Structural and Civil Engineering – Professional Services Agreement",
  "projectDescription": "We are inviting qualified vendors to submit a proposal for the provision of structural and civil engineering services covering a number of subject matter areas as described further within, pertaining to various structures across Banff Centre’s campus.\n\nAn initial priority work package requiring these services has also been included for proposal as described in Appendix E below.\n\nBanff Centre campus hopes to pursue several projects requiring structural and civil engineering consulting, detailed design, and construction oversight services over the next few years, and seeks to form an ongoing Master Services Agreement (“MSA”) as such. These additional projects are not guaranteed and will be executed on an as needed basis.\n\nWhile more than one vendor may be awarded a Master Services Agreement, only one vendor will be awarded the initial work package.",
